  5→ * Dimensions: phase, game mode, player type, score, events, issues,
  6→ * decisions (open/closed, targeted/untargeted), recommendations.
  7→ *
  8→ * Invariants verified:
  9→ * - Header (clocks, phase badge, title) always visible regardless of state
 10→ * - Turn banner + score bar visible iff score is non-null and phase is not "briefing"
 11→ * - Footer text matches game mode × player type
 12→ * - Decision overlay visible iff there is an open decision matching role
 13→ * - Advisor panel shown iff collaborative + advisor role
 14→ * - Decision-maker panel shown iff non-collaborative OR decision-maker role
 15→ * - Advisor bubbles shown iff collaborative + decision-maker + recs exist
 16→ * - Events card always visible; content matches visible events
 17→ * - Issues card always visible; content matches released issues
